 a seamless, professional experience for over 50 million people across 240+ countries.<br><br>But as we got to know our customers, we began to see a deeper truth: Scheduling is just the beginning.&nbsp;<br><br>That's why we're taking on all of the work around meetings — scheduling, payments, meeting notes, follow-ups, contacts, and more. We bring together industry-leading scheduling features, 100+ integrations, and an AI assistant designed to supercharge the way you work.<br><br>From solo business owners to teams within large organizations, professionals trust Calendly to help them get more out of every meeting and make space for what matters.</p></div></astro-island></div></div></section><section id="[About]-Stats" class="flex w-full justify-center relative py-section-default dark"><div aria-hidden="true" data-rounded-divider="true" style="border-bottom-left-radius:var(--radius-ui-fixed-2xl);border-bottom-right-radius:var(--radius-ui-fixed-2xl)" class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 z-20 w-full h-(--section-rounded-divider-height) bg-ramp-orange-025"></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-0 overflow-hidden"><img src="/_astro/callie-socialproof.Jam2Ffup.svg" alt="" loading="eager" aria-hidden="true" class="size-full object-cover select-none"></div><div class="z-10 has-data-scrolljack-overlay:z-1001 w-full flex flex-col @container gap-4xl max-w-[1280px] px-(--section-padding-x)"><astro-island uid="Z2jePP3" prefix="r19" component-url="/_astro/index.CmO4VxXq.js" component-export="HeadingIsland" renderer-url="/_astro/client.DSHm9q9k.js" props="{&quot;alignment&quot;:[0,&quot;centered&quot;],&quot;title&quot;:[0,&quot;Easier meetings for everyone&quot;],&quot;headingSize&quot;:[0,&quot;h1&quot;],&quot;headingFont&quot;:[0,&quot;calendly-sans&quot;],&quot;eyebrow&quot;:[0,{&quot;variant&quot;:[0,&quot;eyebrowOverline&quot;],&quot;badgeLabel&quot;:[0,&quot;Stats&quot;],&quot;accompanyingBadgeLabel&quot;:[0],&quot;badgeSize&quot;:[0,&quot;standard&quot;]}],&quot